From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AGC Developer <developer@agc.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 23:20:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] AGC no-invasion optimisation lanes

Alpha9 remodels aggressive features around no-invasion lanes: network deadline
batching, chunk FIFO fair queueing, entity read-only snapshots, and world
write-intent conflict waves. The world tick executor now consumes planner waves
instead of dispatching every world together.

